            "text": "Phishing fraud involves deceptive tactics to extract sensitive information, often leveraging machine learning (ML) and natural language processing (NLP) for detection. The paper explores adaptive ML techniques, such as **Transfer Learning (TL)** and **Continual Learning (CL)**, to address challenges like **catastrophic forgetting** while improving phishing detection accuracy across evolving datasets.",
